{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31758","headline":"寓兴 · 贾岛","name":"寓兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真集道方至，貌殊妬还多。\n山泉入城池，自然生浑波。\n今时出古言，在衆翻爲讹。\n有琴含正韵，知音者如何。\n一生足感激，世言忽嵯峨。\n不得市井味，思响吾岩阿。\n浮华岂我事，日月徒蹉跎。\n旷哉颍阳风，千载无其他。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}